{
    "title": "Audible: Audio Entertainment",
    "description": "Listen to podcasts and audiobooks that inspire and build an audio library worth sharing. Enjoy audio entertainment of all genres and get lost in some of the world\u2019s most recognizable voices.\r\n\r\nStream your favorite audiobook or podcast series, narrated by a star-studded voice cast. Listen to original audio content and discover new stories with weekly releases. Keep one podcast or audiobook every month as a Premium Plus member or purchase your favorite titles with cash.\r\n\r\nListen to books you\u2019ve been meaning to read for years and browse through thousands of original podcasts. Discover audio stories that speak to you and enjoy audio entertainment at its best with Audible. Let meditation audiobooks and self-help podcasts help you relax and set a Sleep Timer to automatically stop listening.\r\n\r\nPlay audiobook series offline on your next flight or find podcasts to keep you company on the road with Car Mode. Bestselling stories from film & TV \u2014 listen before you watch global favorites in sci-fi, fantasy, romance and more. Build your audio library and immerse yourself in the best in audio entertainment.\r\n\r\nGrow your audio library and explore new worlds with bestselling audiobooks and podcasts. There\u2019s always more to imagine with Audible.\r\n\r\nAUDIBLE FEATURES\r\n\r\nTHE PLUS CATALOG: AUDIO ORIGINALS\r\nPodcasts, audiobooks, and Originals. Listen to thousands of titles, including exclusive series.\r\n\u2022 Download audio content in the Plus Catalog anytime you want, no credits necessary\r\n\u2022 Extensive audio library \u2013 listen to your favorite audiobook & podcast titles\r\n\u2022 Originals & bestsellers \u2013 discover, purchase and listen to trending favorites\r\n\u2022 Romance novels, comedy podcasts or fantasy book series \u2013 find what you need to unwind\r\n\r\nSTORYTELLING: ANYTIME, ANYWHERE\r\nQueue up your favorite audiobook, adjust your listening speed & enjoy captivating storytelling.\r\n\u2022 Stream podcasts or download audiobooks directly to enjoy Audible without WiFi\r\n\u2022 Listen to novels or podcast series on the road with Car Mode through Android Auto\r\n\u2022 Read on your Kindle or switch to Audible to listen on your phone, tablet or Wear OS\r\n\u2022 Bestselling podcasts & audiobooks \u2013 browse through titles & add them to your wish list\r\n\r\nAUDIO ENTERTAINMENT: IGNITE YOUR IMAGINATION\r\nFind inspiration daily with popular audiobooks, eye-opening podcasts & immersive narrations.\r\n\u2022 Tackle your reading list easily by listening to audio stories throughout the day\r\n\u2022 Curate podcasts and audiobooks into a personalized playlist for future listening\r\n\u2022 Listen to audio stories with customizable narration speeds up to 3.5x\r\n\u2022 Leave podcast and book reviews to help others choose their next audio adventure\r\n\r\nAUDIBLE MEMBERSHIP\r\n\r\nFind the plan that works for you with our free 30-day trial. Get the most from your subscription with discounts on our monthly and annual plans. Try cash purchases for titles you love and benefit from discounted prices as an Audible member.\r\n\r\nAUDIBLE PREMIUM PLUS\r\nWith Premium Plus, you can access the Plus Catalog and much more:\r\n\u2022 The entire Plus Catalog \u2013 thousands of titles, podcasts, and Originals\r\n\u2022 Get 1 monthly credit to choose any title you want\r\n\u2022 Listen to an extended selection of bestsellers, Originals and new releases\r\n\u2022 A permanent library! Titles purchased with credits are yours to keep, even if you cancel\r\n\r\nKIDS PROFILES\r\nCreate a Kids Profile for your child and share family-friendly listens from our extensive catalog of children\u2019s audiobooks, podcasts and Originals, right from the app.\r\n\r\nPurchase titles directly or acquire individual credits through the app and expand your audio library anytime with Audible.\r\n\r\n-\r\n\r\nThe most compelling stories and podcasts, told by inspiring voices. Listen to storytelling that speaks to you, anytime, anywhere. Fall in love with books all over again with Audible, an Amazon company.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Listen to podcasts and audiobooks that inspire and build an audio library worth sharing. Enjoy audio entertainment of all genres and get lost in some of the world\u2019s most recognizable voices.<br><br>Stream your favorite audiobook or podcast series, narrated by a star-studded voice cast. Listen to original audio content and discover new stories with weekly releases. Keep one podcast or audiobook every month as a Premium Plus member or purchase your favorite titles with cash.<br><br>Listen to books you\u2019ve been meaning to read for years and browse through thousands of original podcasts. Discover audio stories that speak to you and enjoy audio entertainment at its best with Audible. Let meditation audiobooks and self-help podcasts help you relax and set a Sleep Timer to automatically stop listening.<br><br>Play audiobook series offline on your next flight or find podcasts to keep you company on the road with Car Mode. Bestselling stories from film &amp; TV \u2014 listen before you watch global favorites in sci-fi, fantasy, romance and more. Build your audio library and immerse yourself in the best in audio entertainment.<br><br>Grow your audio library and explore new worlds with bestselling audiobooks and podcasts. There\u2019s always more to imagine with Audible.<br><br>AUDIBLE FEATURES<br><br>THE PLUS CATALOG: AUDIO ORIGINALS<br>Podcasts, audiobooks, and Originals. Listen to thousands of titles, including exclusive series.<br>\u2022 Download audio content in the Plus Catalog anytime you want, no credits necessary<br>\u2022 Extensive audio library \u2013 listen to your favorite audiobook &amp; podcast titles<br>\u2022 Originals &amp; bestsellers \u2013 discover, purchase and listen to trending favorites<br>\u2022 Romance novels, comedy podcasts or fantasy book series \u2013 find what you need to unwind<br><br>STORYTELLING: ANYTIME, ANYWHERE<br>Queue up your favorite audiobook, adjust your listening speed &amp; enjoy captivating storytelling.<br>\u2022 Stream podcasts or download audiobooks directly to enjoy Audible without WiFi<br>\u2022 Listen to novels or podcast series on the road with Car Mode through Android Auto<br>\u2022 Read on your Kindle or switch to Audible to listen on your phone, tablet or Wear OS<br>\u2022 Bestselling podcasts &amp; audiobooks \u2013 browse through titles &amp; add them to your wish list<br><br>AUDIO ENTERTAINMENT: IGNITE YOUR IMAGINATION<br>Find inspiration daily with popular audiobooks, eye-opening podcasts &amp; immersive narrations.<br>\u2022 Tackle your reading list easily by listening to audio stories throughout the day<br>\u2022 Curate podcasts and audiobooks into a personalized playlist for future listening<br>\u2022 Listen to audio stories with customizable narration speeds up to 3.5x<br>\u2022 Leave podcast and book reviews to help others choose their next audio adventure<br><br>AUDIBLE MEMBERSHIP<br><br>Find the plan that works for you with our free 30-day trial. Get the most from your subscription with discounts on our monthly and annual plans. Try cash purchases for titles you love and benefit from discounted prices as an Audible member.<br><br>AUDIBLE PREMIUM PLUS<br>With Premium Plus, you can access the Plus Catalog and much more:<br>\u2022 The entire Plus Catalog \u2013 thousands of titles, podcasts, and Originals<br>\u2022 Get 1 monthly credit to choose any title you want<br>\u2022 Listen to an extended selection of bestsellers, Originals and new releases<br>\u2022 A permanent library! Titles purchased with credits are yours to keep, even if you cancel<br><br>KIDS PROFILES<br>Create a Kids Profile for your child and share family-friendly listens from our extensive catalog of children\u2019s audiobooks, podcasts and Originals, right from the app.<br><br>Purchase titles directly or acquire individual credits through the app and expand your audio library anytime with Audible.<br><br>-<br><br>The most compelling stories and podcasts, told by inspiring voices. Listen to storytelling that speaks to you, anytime, anywhere. Fall in love with books all over again with Audible, an Amazon company.",
